## 🛠️ CLI Tooling: `game_exploratory_fuzzer.py`

Located at: `scripts/game_exploratory_fuzzer.py`

### 1. Run Evolutionary Input Fuzzing:
```bash
python3 scripts/game_exploratory_fuzzer.py fuzz --duration 30 --population 10 --mutation-rate 0.25 --corpus-dir .qa_corpus
```

### 2. Minimize Crash Trajectory (Delta Debugging):
```bash
python3 scripts/game_exploratory_fuzzer.py minimize --trace-file .qa_corpus/crash_trace_142.json --out-minimal .qa_corpus/minimal_repro.json
```

### 3. Replay Saved Trajectory:
```bash
python3 scripts/game_exploratory_fuzzer.py replay --trace-file .qa_corpus/minimal_repro.json
```

### 4. Headless Dry-Run (CI / Verification):
```bash
python3 scripts/game_exploratory_fuzzer.py fuzz --dry-run
```

